  [Tool Call]: write_file({'file_path': 'project_plan.md', 'text': '# Advanced Scientific Calculator - Project Plan\n\n## Overview\nThis project aims to develop a world-class Advanced Scientific Calculator with a premium UI/UX and robust mathematical capabilities.\n\n## Technology Stack\n- **GUI Framework**: CustomTkinter (for premium aesthetics and cross-platform compatibility)\n- **Math Engine**: SymPy (for symbolic mathematics) and standard Python math library\n- **History Persistence**: SQLite database\n- **Packaging**: PyInstaller or similar for standalone executable\n\n## Architecture Components\n1. **UI Layer**\n   - Main Window with modern dark/light theme support\n   - Input field for expressions\n   - Display area for results\n   - History panel showing past calculations\n   - Buttons for scientific functions\n   - Menu for settings/preferences\n\n2. **Logic Layer**\n   - Expression Parser/Evaluator\n   - Scientific Functions Implementation\n   - History Manager (SQLite integration)\n   - Error Handling Module\n\n3. **Data Layer**\n   - SQLite database for storing calculation history\n\n## Development Phases\n1. UI Design & Implementation\n2. Core Logic Development\n3. Integration of UI and Logic\n4. History Feature Implementation\n5. Testing & Polish\n6. Packaging & Deployment\n\n## Team Responsibilities\n- **slave1**: UI/UX Design and Implementation\n- **slave2**: Core Mathematical Logic Engine\n- **rootMaster**: Overall architecture, integration, and final packaging\n\n## Milestones\n1. Complete UI Design Document (slave1)\n2. Complete Logic Engine Specification (slave2)\n3. Working prototype with basic operations\n4. Full scientific function implementation\n5. History feature with SQLite integration\n6. Final testing and deployment package'})
